<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53689" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταβιβρώσκω</span></b>  (pres. not found,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσθίω</span>
			), aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατέβρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Ap.</u>
					127
				</span></i>
			: pf.
			
				Pass.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταβέβρωμαι</span>: aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατεβρώθην</span> (v.
				infr.):—<i>eat up, devour,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Ap.
			</span></i> l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταβεβρωκὼς σιτία ἴσως ἐλεφάντων
					τεττάρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					82
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταβεβρώκασι . . τὰς οὐσίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hegesipp.Com.
					1.30
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὄντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hyp.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					249
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ εὐλέων κατεβρώθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.16
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατεβρώθη ὑπὸ τῶν ἰδίων κυνῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Palaeph.
					6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταβέβρωται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.199
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπ᾽ ἰχθύων</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mort.</u>
				32
			</span></i>; <i>to be corroded</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				110a
			</span></i>.</div>
